    <informations>Shelly i4 Gen3 — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: SW4 SW3 SW2 SW1 L L N.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-i4-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_ef1de777f620e3432d6cb44e639ad27da70fe0d0156f21ae58ec4f2151dcd09e/Shelly%20i4%20Gen3.jpg?cb=8aba9f3bef46214abd7770108313b359
